  "body": "A rare offering in prestigious St Heliers, this exceptional brand-new freehold residence delivers refined luxury on an impressive scale — just a short stroll from St Heliers Beach and Village.\r\n\r\nDesigned for sophisticated modern living, the home features five generous bedrooms, four beautifully appointed bathrooms, including three ensuites, and multiple living spaces, offering an exceptional sense of space, privacy and versatility for modern family life.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, a sophisticated designer kitchen showcases premium Miele appliances, generous workspace and a separate scullery, seamlessly connecting with the open-plan dining and family areas before flowing outdoors to the expansive deck for effortless entertaining. A separate lounge with fireplace provides an elegant retreat and valuable separation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the thoughtfully designed accommodation is particularly impressive. Three of the five bedrooms enjoy their own private ensuites, while generous wardrobes and excellent storage throughout provide the comfort and privacy expected of a home of this calibre — ideal for large or extended families and visiting guests.\r\n\r\nAn internal-access double garage, generous additional off-street parking, excellent storage, landscaped outdoor spaces and a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee complete this outstanding residence.\r\n\r\nYet perhaps the greatest luxury is the location.\r\n\r\nSt Heliers Beach, the waterfront, cafés, restaurants and village amenities are all within easy walking distance, placing one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal lifestyles right at your doorstep. Families will also appreciate the sought-after zoning for St Heliers School and Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nBrand-new homes of this scale and calibre are exceptionally rare in established St Heliers. Combining five bedrooms, four bathrooms, three ensuites, generous parking, premium finishes and an enviable coastal lifestyle, this remarkable residence presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a sophisticated new home in one of Auckland’s most tightly held neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nExperience this exceptional St Heliers residence for yourself.",
